---
import Shot from './Shot.astro';
---
<section id="learns" class="section learns" aria-labelledby="learns-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 id="learns-title" class="claim">It learns what comes next. On this Mac.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        After a while, the list opens with what you usually do next, and says why in plain words. Command-Return runs it.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="reason">
        <span class="bead" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p>After Run Tests you chose Commit 9 of 12 times.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <dl class="ledger">
        <div>
          <dt>It learns from</dt>
          <dd>Command names, the app, the time of day.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>It never keeps</dt>
          <dd>Your selection, web addresses, document names, or what you typed.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>You stay in charge</dt>
          <dd>Dismiss a suggestion, forget a habit, pause learning for an hour, or turn it off.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="small">
        Typing gets smarter too: two swapped letters still find the item, accents do not matter, and short names you
        type often are remembered as your own abbreviations.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Shot id="usually-next" ratio={1.15} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw" class="pic" />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .reason {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--r-box);
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.7vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .reason .bead {
    flex: none;
  }
  .ledger {
    display: grid;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .ledger div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 170px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .ledger dt {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ledger dd {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .ledger div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>
